# OCF Attention (PLUS-FOCUS, OCF-FND-002) background arc — SBaGenX binaural bed.
# Original OCF-authored sequence.
#
# Timeline is a beat-frequency arc aligned to the Attention narration, not a
# Focus-state sequence (see OCF-BG-0002 provenance.notes):
#   0:00-3:18    alpha ~10 Hz hold
#   3:18-6:31    smooth slide 10 Hz -> 16 Hz
#   6:31-13:20   beta 16 Hz hold
#   13:20-16:54  smooth slide 16 Hz -> 10 Hz
#   16:54-30:00  alpha ~10 Hz hold (delivery trims to the narration length)
#
# The Focus-state program of the Focus 11 Access Channel is Focus 10 ->
# Focus 11 -> Focus 10 and is carried by OCF-BG-0011, which splices the
# Focus-11 access state into this bed. This file defines only the carrier
# arc; it does not itself define a Focus-state sequence, and Focus 3 is
# not part of it.
#
# 200 Hz carrier binaural beats with a soft pink-noise bed. Binaural tones
# require headphones. None of OCF's promises are psychoacoustic; this is a
# low-level tonal bed under narration.
-S
-E
-Q
-V 60

alpha-10: 200+10/30 pink/25
beta-16:  200+16/30 pink/25

NOW+00:00:00 == alpha-10 ->
NOW+00:03:18 == alpha-10 ->
NOW+00:06:31 == beta-16 ->
NOW+00:13:20 == beta-16 ->
NOW+00:16:54 == alpha-10 ->
NOW+00:30:00 == alpha-10